# core.autocrlf is true here, so the working tree is CRLF and the index is LF.
# Two things in this repo are hashed, and both must survive that round trip.
#
# Fonts are hashed BYTE-EXACT by tools/check-font-coverage.mjs. If git ever applied
# text conversion to a TTF it would corrupt the file and change the hash, so they are
# declared binary explicitly rather than left to heuristics.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary

# The verbatim injections are hashed by tools/check-governance.mjs invariant 6. That
# hash is taken over LINE-ENDING-NORMALISED text, so it is portable across platforms
# either way - this just keeps the checkout itself stable.
INJECTIONS/*.md text eol=lf
INJECTIONS/injections.lock text eol=lf
